Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Ah...!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.31,0:02:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mooks!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I let him get away because of you guys! -OG}He got away because of you!{JT}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He was a money spinner! -OG}{He was a money maker! -JT}He was our golden goose!{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.87,0:02:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, you fools! We're gonna\Narrest all of you in our way! -OG}{Move, you fools! We're gonna\Narrest everyone in our way! -Ryan}{Everybody, move!\NDon't think we won't arrest you all! Z- The line didn't sound natural.}Vacate the premises!\NDon't think we won't arrest all of you!{Evo: took my favourite bits from each.}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.11,0:02:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are you doing, Navy?!\NDon't bother Soul King!}{What's the Navy doing?!\NLeave Soul King alone! -Byron}{What are you doing, Navy?!\NLeave Soul King alone! - Evo, wasn't a big fan of saying "the Navy" to a soldier's face, even though it technically does work it sounds weird to me.}What are you doing, Navy?!\NDon't interrupt Soul King!{arch: opted for accuracy here - they don't want them to interrupt the concert/speech}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Hey, what's going on there?}Hey, what's happening in there?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's out of control!}It's a riot!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.85,0:02:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The Navy who came here to\Narrest Soul King has been-OG}{The Marines who came to\Narrest Soul King are being -VG}{The marines here to arrest Soul King are\Nbeing blocked by his fans -Ryan- combined lines, lmk if I did this wrong lmao}The Navy suddenly stormed in here\Nready to arrest Soul King,{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and he got away somehow!-OG}{and he somehow got away! -VG}but he got away because\Nhis fans blocked the marines!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Damn! That traitor!}Damn it all!\NWhy, that backstabbing...!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yes, I have some big news!}That's right! This is big news!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.39,0:02:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The musician, Brook, is a\Nfriend of Straw Hat Luffy}The musician Brook\Nis on Straw Hat Luffy's crew!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and he is a pirate himself! -OG}He's actually a pirate!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.67,0:03:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Thank you! The timing was perfect!}You have my thanks!\NThat's what I'd call good timing.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.74,0:03:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Sister Shakky asked me to do this! Your friends will be waiting at Grove #42!}Big Sis Shakky sent me!\NYour friends should be waiting at Grove 42!{Z- I'm surprised none of you touched this line; it starts with "Sister Shakky..." This makes it sound like she's a nun or something.}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!\NMy heart is filled with anticipation!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have a heart to be filled.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.66,0:03:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Ow! That's right!}That's right!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.69,0:03:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{The Navy has set out and Luffy\Nshould be here somewhere! -OG}The Navy is on the move,\Nand Luffy is in the area!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.63,0:03:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{We're gonna take Sunny to Grove\N#42 so come meet us there! -OG}{We're gonna take Sunny to\NGrove #42 so come meet us there! -Ryan}We're taking the {\i0}Sunny{\i1} to Grove 42,\Nso we'll see you there!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.24,0:03:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Clank.-OG}{Ka-lick. -Ryan, none of the above}{VG-clank? ka-lick. }
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.94,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.88,0:03:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy. Come. We. Ship. Run.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Get that?}{Got it? - Byron}Understand?{Evo: wasn't a big fan of the "got it" being followed up by "I don't", this feels better across the two lines.}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.15,0:03:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{No, I don't! Why are you talking like that?! Say it in a proper sentence! -OG}No, I don't! Why are you talking\Nlike that?! Just say it normally!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I thought a musclehead like you\Ncouldn't understand sentences. -OG}{I didn't think a meathead like you\Nwould understand it. -Ryan}A meathead like you wouldn't understand it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.96,0:04:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. You. Later. Slashed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you hear that uproar?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.07,0:04:09.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right. There. Noisy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Shut up, you guys! -OG}Shut up, morons!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We already found one of the\Nperpetrators -OG}{We have found one of the\Nabsolute morons -VG}{We found one of the fools -Byron}We've gone and found\None of the perpetrators...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{who have insulted me!-OG}{who dared to insult me! -VG}{who dared to insult me! -Byron}who dared to show me disrespect!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's this guy! -OG}This guy!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.39,0:04:37.09,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'll teach him a lesson first!-OG}{I'm gonna teach him a lesson! - VG}I'll start by teaching {\i1}this{\i0} guy a lesson!{arch: could replace "him" -> "this/that one" - point is that he's explicitly saying "first", since he'll probably give a speech or w/e later}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.23,0:04:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{About how formidable I am!-OG}{About how powerful I am! -VG}{I'll show him how powerful I am! -Ryan}I'll show him... just how terrifying I can be!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.23,0:04:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what I'm about to do to him...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{is a warning to you all, my men!}will be a warning\Nto each and every one of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.81,0:04:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If you mess with me, this\Nis how you're gonna end up!-OG}Mess with me, and this is\Nwhat you're gonna get!{VG}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya get my meaning, lubbers?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A guy with a 400 million\Nberry bounty sure is scary! -OG}A guy with a 400-million-belly bounty\Nsure is scary!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Sanji, do you know him?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.56,0:05:07.12,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Well you see, a little while ago... -OG}Well, earlier...{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's it, you pirates!-OG}Hold it, you pirates!{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.10,0:05:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Straw Hat Luffy and his\Nfollowing! Just surrender!-OG}{Straw Hat Luffy and his\Nfollowers! Just surrender!}{VG}{Straw Hat Luffy and his\Nfollowers! Surrender now! -Byron}Straw Hat Luffy and all his followers,\Nsurrender now!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The Navy...? -OG}Th-The Navy...?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.87,0:05:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We're blocking off every exit of Grove 46! -OG}We've blocked off every exit from Grove 46!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You can't get away now! -OG}{There's no escape!-Z}There's no escape now!{Roki}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.58,0:05:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Huh? How did the Navy find out about me? -OG}H... How did the Navy find out about me?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are you talking about? -OG}What do you mean by that?!{-Ryan}{Evo: reluctant about this due to the alternative connotation as if Drip is figuring out that this is the real Luffy or something, but CPS-wise this option does make sense so I'll leave it for now.}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.95,0:05:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain! We're under siege!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is why we recruited the new members! -OG}{This is what the new members are for! - Z}Why do you think we got\Nall these new members?{arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.96,0:05:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We have guys with bounties over 100 million! -OG}{We got some with bounties over 100 million! -Ryan}Some of 'em are worth over 100 million!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But there are a lot of them... -OG}But we're outnumbered...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Stupid! Watch this! -OG}Just watch, dumbass!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Caribou!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.06,0:05:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Use the Navy soldier as a\Nshield and make a way out! -OG}Use that marine as a shield to clear a path!{Z- "Navy soldier" just doesn't work as a term. It can be Navy man, marine, or maybe even "seaman," like with the U.S. Navy. Soldiers are generally a term associated with the Army.}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.47,0:05:50.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Navy soldier? -OG}"Marine"...?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.63,0:05:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They caught our scout! - Z- part of this line is missing its translation}It seems like they may have\Ncaught one of our scouts!{arch - lit: it appears they ...}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.67,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Caribou?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.67,0:06:00.51,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{We got to use him to get away from here! -OG}Using him is our ticket outta here!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.08,0:06:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, Big Boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.82,0:06:06.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Because this soldier lied to me... -OG}{This soldier lied to me -Ryan}Because this soldier told a lie...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.62,0:06:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{saying he hadn't called the Navy yet! -OG}{and said he hadn't called the Navy yet! -Ryan}He said he hadn't called the Navy yet!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{No, stupid! -OG}{You idiot! Don't! -Ryan}Don't do it!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That crazy ass! He ignored my order!}That lunatic ignored my order!{Byron:"Ass" feels out of place in that sentence.}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.27,0:06:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, he did it...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.11,0:06:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There is an unspoken rule that you\Ncan just tell a lie to bad guys-OG}{There seems to be an unspoken rule\Nthat you can just lie to the bad guys -VG}They seem to follow an underhanded rule\Nthat lets them lie to their enemies!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{but we should put a stop to that!-OG}{but I disagree! -VG}Boy, do I find that distasteful!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.08,0:06:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Looks like you guys have\Nno intention to surrender!}Looks like they have\Nno intention of surrendering!{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.89,0:06:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let's get the pirates!}{Destroy the pirates! -Byron}After them! Get those pirates!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.76,0:06:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Fools! Our boss is a man with a 400\Nmillion bounty - Straw Hat Luffy! -OG}{Fools! Our boss is worth 400 million!\NHe's Straw Hat Luffy! -Ryan}Knuckleheads! Our boss is worth 400 million!\NHe's Straw Hat Luffy, y'know?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let's fight! -OG}Bring it on!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't good, Captain. Let's run!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.77,0:07:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You fools! You have to listen to me! -OG}You ingrates! Listen to your captain!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Huh? What are they calling me "boss"? -OG}Huh? Why would they be calling me "boss"?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Again, what are you talking about? Evo: should this be made consistent with the earlier line?}Again, what do you mean by that?{Z- Yep, this should be consistent. Earlier line is @04:52}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't be scared! Go! -OG}Fight with courage!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The 88 million berry bounty\N- Lip "Service" Doughty! -OG}the man worth 88 million,\NLip "Service" Doughty!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I liked the way you fight.-OG}{I like the way you fight. -VG}I just love the way you fight.{Z- Needs to be more... lip-service-y}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared! Get ready to shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.21,0:07:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's got a 92 million berry bounty... -OG}{He's got a 92-million-belly bounty... -Ryan}He's got a bounty of 92 million...{Evo: making the bounty notations within the area more consistent with each other.}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{"Gashed" Albion! -OG}{Albion the Maimed! - went back and forth on quotes per the style guide, feels and looks better without them imo -Ryan}Albion "the Maimed"!{Evo: I referred to the guideline as well as RTS 2 and with quotes looks like the way to go, though I see how it's kinda awkward.}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Fight for justice!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.83,0:08:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stinks! Hypocrites' blood!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A 210 million bounty - "Wet-Haired" Caribou! -OG}{A 210 million bounty...\Nthe pirate "Wet-Haired" Caribou! -Ryan}A bounty of 210 million...\NPirate "Wet-Haired" Caribou!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender now!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What?! You're a Devil Fruit eater?!}{What?! You're a Devil Fruit user?!}{What?! You're a devil fruit user?! -Ryan}Oh, no! You've eaten a devil fruit?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.54,0:08:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You should not do that! -OG}{You shouldn't do that! -Ryan}You shouldn't have done that!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not healthy to push yourself too hard!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My sword...!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Whoa! What is it now?! -OG}Wh-Whoa! {\i1}Now{\i0} what's going on?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifista!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.72,0:08:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are the Navy's human weapons here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.47,0:08:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're the bear-like men! -OG}Those're the guys that look like Kuma!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Hancock told me not to cause trouble...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.61,0:08:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Again, what the hell are you talking about?! -Evo: again would consistency be needed here?}Seriously, what the hell \N{\i1}do{\i0} you mean by that?!{Z- yep! see @04:52 and 06:29}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.32,0:08:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A pirate--Straw Hat Luffy. Verified. -OG}{The pirate Straw Hat Luffy. Verified.-Ryan}Pirate Straw Hat Luffy: Confirmed.{Evo: also considered some sort of dash but colon probably works best. Wondering whether without the "the" we can really hammer down on the simplistic robotic dialogue, but it might also read awkwardly.}{What about "Confirmed" instead of "Verified" ? - arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.69,0:09:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Are those real Pacifistas?\NThey're aiming at me?! -OG}Are those actual pacifista?\NAnd they're actually shooting at me?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.26,0:09:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Pacifistas, huh? It's exciting! -OG}Pacifista, you say? How thrilling!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.67,0:09:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{88 million berry bounty. Lip\N"Service" Doughty. Subdued. -OG}88-million-belly bounty,\NLip "Service" Doughty: Subdued.{-Ryan}{Evo: removed 8 frames off this line to improve timing on the next one as per Ryan's comment.}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Doughty!{comes in a little late -Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.84,0:09:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow the pacifista! Catch the pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.02,0:09:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One shot?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He had an 88 million bounty\Nand he was no match... -OG}{Even with a bounty of 88 million,\Nhe didn't stand a chance...-Ryan}Even with a bounty of 88 million,\Nhe was no match.{Evo: CPS, and I don't think ellipses are appropriate here anyways.}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.52,0:09:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is bad news... Oh,\NCaptain, where are you going? -OG}This is bad news...\NWait, Captain, where are you going?!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.42,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.42,0:09:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Fools! I don't wanna fight\Nhim - he beat Doughty! We better run!}{Fools! We can't fight\Nhim - he beat Doughty! We better run! Byron:not sure if I should remove the - or not}{Fools! We can't fight him\Nif he beat Doughty! We better run! -Ryan}{Morons! He beat Doughty,\Nso we're no match! We better run! - Z}Morons! He wrecked Doughty,\Nso we got no chance! We better run!{arch: the dude fking exploded, that's not just "beat" - and the japanese also reflects that. Lit. it's "crushed". Also, "no match" is repetitive with 8:47, but I didn't find anything better}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Straw Hat Boss}Boss Straw Hat, do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.14,0:09:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If nothing is done, those human\Nweapons will kill us all! -OG}{If this keeps up, those\Nhuman weapons will kill us all! -Ryan}If this keeps up,\Nthose human weapons will kill us all!{Evo: changed line spacing}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss–
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss is gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's how they call Straw Hat? -OG}{That's what they call Straw Hat? -Ryan}Do they mean Straw Hat?{Evo: based off Gaijin's suggestion in discord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! My side hurts!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.72,0:10:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Fool! Run! They're gonna kill you! -OG}You morons...! Run, or they'll kill–{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Stupid! You're in my way! -OG}You're in the way, idiot!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.97,0:10:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.64,0:10:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Why are they calling you Straw Hat?}Why are you going around as Straw Hat?{Evo: based off Gaijin's suggestion in discord.}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.44,0:10:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, you! Don't you know who I am?}{Hey! Don't you know who I am? -Byron}H-H-Hey, bastard!\NDon't you know who I am?!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.78,0:10:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Get out of my way or I'll kill\Nyou and pull out your bowels!-OG}{Get out of my way or I'll kill\Nyou rip out your guts! -VG}Get out of my way or I'll kill you\Nand tear out your guts!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.69,0:10:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This may surprise you! I'm the\NRevolutionary Dragon's son! -OG}Haven't you heard?!\NI'm the son of Dragon the Revolutionary!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.86,0:10:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And the grandson of the hero--Garp! -OG}I'm the grandson of Garp the Hero!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.59,0:10:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm a big-time pirate with a\N400 million bounty--Straw... -OG}I'm a famous pirate\Nwith a 400-million-belly bounty, Straw–{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.54,0:10:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Straw Hat is not scum like you!}Straw Hat is not scum like you!{Byron}{Straw Hat ain't scum like you! -I think OG is fine -Ryan}{Evo: does Sentomaru ever use words like "ain't"?}{Z- I prefer Byron's line. "ain't" defintely doesn't sound like Sentomaru}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.94,0:10:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.81,0:11:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Straw Hat Boss! -OG}Boss Straw Hat!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Now I get it.{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.55,0:11:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They all got fooled and became his crew. -OG}{They all got fooled and joined his crew. -Byron}They all got tricked into joining\N a fake Straw Hat crew.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{PX-5, who is he for real? -OG}{PX-5, who is this guy? -Ryan}PX-5, who is this guy really?{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.40,0:11:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{"Triple-Tongued" Demaro Black. -OG}Pirate "Triple-Tongued" Demaro Black.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.63,0:11:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A 26 million berry bounty. -OG}Bounty: 26-million-belly.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty-six million? That means he's...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.57,0:11:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{An impostor?! -OG}a fake?!{Z- they're the "Fake Straw Hats," so using "fake" here, lol}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.41,0:11:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They found out! Let's run!}{They know! Run for it! -Byron}{They all found out! Run for it!-Ryan}They found out! Run for it!{Evo: should either be "they found out" or "they all know", and I'm leaning towards option 1.}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.31,0:11:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What's up with that shit?! -OG}What's with this loser?!{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So he posed as Straw Hat\NLuffy and tricked us! -OG}He posed as Straw Hat Luffy and tricked us!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because the real one is dead!{OG+arch}{Because the real one is said to be dead! - Roki}{It's impossible to hear here, but in the manga the line is "本物が死んだのをいい事に", so いい comes from 良 and not 言. Lit: "He used the fact that the real one is dead as an opportunity" Alt. line: "He used the real one's death", but OG is fine i think}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.62,0:11:51.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Damn! I almost got ripped off by a jerk with a measly 26 million berry bounty! -OG}Damn! I almost took orders from a weakling\Nwith a measly 26-million-belly bounty!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.93,0:11:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So He was posing as me? -OG}He was pretending to be me?{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That Sanji and Zoro, too? -OG}Sanji and Zoro too?{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They looked just like the real ones!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.64,0:12:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I better leave here before it's too late. -OG}{I'd better get out of here before it's too late. -VG}I'd better leave before anything else happens.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.11,0:12:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The one who fooled you is an idiot\Nbut you guys are just unlucky. -OG}{The faker is an idiot,\Nbut you guys are just unlucky. - Ryan}{Evo: for TLQC, is this really what he says? He seems like someone who would judge them for actually falling for that act. Would it work better if he says "but you guys are unlucky, too" as in they're both idiots AND unlucky because he's there?}{Roki - it does sound like he's saying they are fools and unlucky as well, but I'm not sure the current line needs changing}That faker is an idiot,\Nbut you morons are also out of luck.{arch: maybe find better insults, but this is how I'd translate it}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You all have to come with us. -OG}You're all under arrest!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.95,0:12:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And I don't know why but the\Nreal Straw Hat is here too. -OG}{And for some reason,\Nthe real Straw Hat is here too. -Ryan}And as it so happens,\Nthe real Straw Hat is here too.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.52,0:12:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{When we entered this area, PX-5 detected him. -OG}PX-5 detected him\Nthe instant we entered this area.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Shoot at him, PX-5!-OG}Shoot him, PX-5!{VG}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are you doing?!}What was that for?!{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.41,0:12:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This bag is holding all my precious lunches!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{H-Here's his poster... -OG}{Th-The face on the poster... -Byron: This line didnt lead well into the other line}{His... His face on the p-p-poster...Z}His... His face...{Roki}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.06,0:12:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– Looks exactly the same!\N– Looks exactly the same! -OG}{– They're exactly the same!\N– They're exactly the same!Z}It's just like the poster!{Roki-this looks...weird, I'm inclined to just put "the poster!"}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.83,0:13:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So that guy is the real Straw Hat!-OG}So that guy was the real Straw Hat!{VG}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.97,0:13:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Brace up! -OG}Form up!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.44,0:13:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We came here to catch the real one anyway! -OG}We were already prepared\Nto catch the real one!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aye, sir!\N– Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.21,0:13:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, it's you! Are you gonna\Nget in my way again?! -OG}What?! Are you gonna\Ntry and stop me again?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.24,0:13:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I've been told not to cause\Ntrouble in order to set sail! -OG}{I got told not to cause any trouble\Nif I wanted to set sail... -Ryan}{Evo: bit hesitant about this phrasing but I can't really find a great alternative either.}I'm supposed to stay out of trouble\Nso I can set sail!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.71,0:13:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry! You don't need to set sail!}Don't worry! You won't need to set sail!{-Byron}{That's fine! You won't be able to set sail! -Ryan}{Evo: reverted to Byron's phrasing}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.35,0:13:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unlike two years ago,\NI'm officially a member of the Navy now!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So I'm gonna catch you here! -OG}So, this is where I capture you!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.53,0:13:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's slow...-OG}Too slow...{VG}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.87,0:13:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gear Second!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jet Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.41,0:14:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He is using haki! -OG}That's... haki!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.95,0:14:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat the pacifista with a single blow!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.83,0:14:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I think I'll see you somewhere again! -OG}{I think I'll see you again somewhere! -Byron}I bet we'll meet again somewhere!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't let Straw Hat get away!-OG}Don't let Straw Hat escape!{VG}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.57,0:14:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I knew it was you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Why are you always in trouble?! -OG}How'd you get in trouble already?!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.51,0:14:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.38,0:15:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's no mistake this time!\NIt's been a while, guys! -OG}It's really you this time!\NIt's been a while, guys!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.22,0:15:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Roronoa! Black Leg!\NI knew they were alive! - OG}Roronoa! Black Leg!\NSo they really were alive!{arch: he ends with か, so I think "I knew" is too strong}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-7!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Outta my way!\N– Outta my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cut him!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I broke his neck!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.11,0:15:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The Straw Hats! The real ones! -OG}It's the Straw Hats!\NThe {\i1}real{\i0} ones!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're nothing like the impostors! -OG}{The Fake Straw Hats are nothing like them! - Z}They're nothing like the fake Straw Hats!{arch: probably talking about their powers, not their looks}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Luffy, you're the 9th. -OG}Hey, Luffy, you're ninth.{Ryan}{Hey, Luffy, you're No. 9. -Evo: matched phrasing from RTS 2}{Z- these ordinal numbers should be spelled out. We'll need to make sure it's spelled out in RtS 02 as well.}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Shut up! Cut it out! -OG}{Shut up! That's enough of that! - Z}Shut up! Imagine gloating about that!{arch: proud of him being first}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.90,0:15:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy, hurry up!  Everybody's\Nwaiting at the ship! -OG}Luffy, hurry up!\NEveryone's waiting at the ship!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.90,0:15:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!\NCatch them at any cost!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aye, sir!\N– Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.24,0:16:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's really been a long time!\NI wonder how everybody is! -OG}{It's been such a long time!\NI can't wait to see everyone! -Ryan}It's been such a long time!\NI hope everyone's doing alright!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.89,0:16:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.03,0:16:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{D-}Dark King Rayleigh?!{no stutter here as far as I can tell -Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I came here to check but you seem alright. -OG}I came here to check on you,\Nbut you seem to be doing fine.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.38,0:16:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've refined your skills even further.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.25,0:16:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.71,0:16:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Now go to your friends! -OG}Now get going!\NYour friends are waiting.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.22,0:16:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Rayleigh, thank you\Nfor everything these past {2}two years!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.06,0:16:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're out of character. Just go! -OG}This isn't like you at all. Just go!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.70,0:17:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.48,0:17:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!}I'm gonna become the pirate king!{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get Straw Hat already!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.27,0:17:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, thank you for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, Rayleigh...!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.04,0:17:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.41,0:17:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.72,0:17:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.54,0:18:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They went that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– Go after them!\N– Don't let them get away! -OG}After them!\NDon't let them get away!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rise to the top!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.65,0:18:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are heading for Grove 42!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.17,0:18:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's a new beginning for my pupil! - OG}My protégé is setting sail!{arch: this can mean "new beginning" idiomatically, but since he really is setting sail, I'd say this should be used. Maybe something like "My pupil is departing anew" if we can word it to sound more normal.}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be too hard on him.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this line?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I recommend you not to cross it. -OG}{I'd advise against crossing it. -Ryan}I recommend you do not cross it.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.68,0:18:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, bon bags! A lot of them! -OG}Oh, bon bags! There're so many!{We should check if bon bags is consistent, I couldn't check right now-Roki}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's in them?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.52,0:19:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're all filled with food. I know everybody's stomach got\Nbigger these past 2 years. -OG}{They're all filled with food. I know everyone's stomachs got bigger over the past two years. -Ryan}They're filled with food. I imagine everyone's\Nstomachs got bigger over the past two years.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you fill up later!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.90,0:19:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Really?! Can't wait to eat your food! -OG}Really?! I can't wait to eat your food!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There they are! They're this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh? They went round! -OG}{Oh? They went around! -Ryan}Oh? They circled ahead!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We have no choice! -OG}No other choice, huh?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.71,0:19:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody, charge!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.71,0:19:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna... become a flea...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What're you...?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a mite...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What happened? -OG}What in the world...?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.23,0:19:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a louse...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.14,0:19:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I knew it was you guys -OG}{I knew you guys -Ryan}{As I suspected, fellas;-Z}As I suspected,{Roki, we could keep Z's version, but it honestly looked weird to me}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.64,0:19:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{causing all of this! -OG}{were causing all of this! -Ryan}this mess is {\i1}your{\i0} doing.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.25,0:19:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You haven't gotten anywhere yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.52,0:20:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh! I know you from Thriller Bark! -OG}That's right!\NI remember you from Thriller Bark!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.59,0:20:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Who was she? -OG}{Who's she? -Ryan}Who was she?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.99,0:20:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You can't talk to me like\Nthat! I brought you back here! -OG}{Don't talk to me like that!\NI brought you back here! -Ryan}You should be nicer to the one\Nwho brought you back to this island!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.93,0:20:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If it weren't for me, you would be... -OG}If I hadn't directed you, why, you'd be...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You must learn your place... -OG}Just try a little gratitu–{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.41,0:20:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Sniff, sniff...}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.81,0:20:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A real woman! A real woman!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.54,0:20:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Of course I am! What kind\Nof sickness do you have? -OG}Of course I am!\NWhat are you, sick?{-Ryan}{This means "sick" as in "insane" (lit. "sick in the head"), but I don't see a better way to clarify that.}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.01,0:20:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, set sail already!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw some Navy ships around here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon, there'll be no way out!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.53,0:20:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That must be... -OG}That voice...!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.69,0:20:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp-{\i1}san{\i0}! Nami-{\i1}san{\i0}! Robin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{FFFranky-san! -OG}{Franky-san! -Ryan}Frrranky-{\i1}san{\i0}!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.11,0:20:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.91,0:21:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I can't believe you abandoned stardom!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.91,0:21:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.02,0:21:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two have become even more beautiful!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, Nami-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two years, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, are you gonna sing for us? -OG}Ah! You wrote a song for us?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Could I look at your panties... -OG}{May I see your panties– -Ryan}...{I would very much like to see your pa–}would you be so kind\Nas to show me your pa–
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you{\i0} think?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I never let you see them even 2 years ago! -OG}{I never let you see them before, either! -Ryan}I never let you see them two years ago either!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so excited to see you again... See?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.21,0:21:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's shaking my soul... Although... -OG}{It's... shaking my soul... Although... -Ryan}It's... making my heart quiver...\NAlthough...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.98,0:21:44.25,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{I don't have a soul to be shaken...}I don't have a heart that can quiver...{Z- can we translate this as "heart" instead of "soul"? It would be a better skeleton pun... and besides, I'm pretty sure Brook has a soul.}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.72,0:21:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, the big star is having a spasm. -OG}{Hey, the big star's having a fit. -Ryan}Hey... The rock star just hit rock bottom.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.25,0:21:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Honestly! None of you guys have grown up. -OG}Honestly! You guys are still immature.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.49,0:21:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{By the way...\NI don't see everybody here yet. -OG}By the way...\NI don't see everyone on board yet.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.70,0:21:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{--Oh yeah, Chopper went to pick them up. -OG}{– That's right. Chopper went to pick them up.}Oh, right.\NChopper went to pick them up–{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.87,0:21:58.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.17,0:21:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.81,0:22:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Here they come finally! -OG}Took 'em long enough!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wow, hey! -OG}{No way! Hey!}{Ryan- not sure about this one but OG was strange }{Evo: Yea I don't really like either of these... if I had to choose I'd say OG though. Might even be best to just keep it simple at "Hey!"}Hey!{Z- simple "hey" wins the day}
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.98,0:22:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found them!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.42,0:22:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.43,0:22:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.63,0:22:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}san{\i0}! I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.43,0:22:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You guys sure do look stronger! - OG}You guys sure do look manlier!{arch: this is closer to the meaning, and "stronger" is just way too cliche. The fan translated manga has "you guys look more manly than ever!".}
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.74,0:22:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all back together again!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Finally... -OG}Finally–
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.35,0:22:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.21,0:22:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.06,0:23:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.54,0:23:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Say "hi" to everybody in\NBirdie Kingdom for me! -OG}Say hi to everyone\Nin the Torino Kingdom for me!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.61,0:23:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Is Sanji alright?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.81,0:23:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One... One... One beautiful woman...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.01,0:23:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.91,0:23:20.52,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Two beautiful women...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, this is no good, Chopper! Stop the bleeding! -OG}Chopper, this is real bad!\NWe gotta stop the bleeding!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.02,0:23:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-F-Franky, you're...!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.96,0:23:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.59,0:23:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something that concerns you-{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\i1\b1}mecha{\fn\i0\b0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.30,0:23:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{"Mecha"?! I wanna play! - OG}"Mecha"?! I wanna try too!{arch - lit: he wants to push the nose button}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.23,0:23:37.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.97,0:23:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I don't know what's so\Ngreat and besides that, -OG}{It doesn't seem that cool, and besides,-Ryan}{It doesn't even seem that cool, - Evo}Leave that crap for later!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.64,0:23:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{it looks like the Navy\Nships are already here! -OG}{and besides,\Nthe Navy ships are already here! - Ryan}It looks like the Navy ships\Nare already here!{arch+OG}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.88,0:23:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! When did they get here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.28,0:23:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There are three Navy ships! -OG}Three Navy ships!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.58,0:23:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, should we fight back?!\NThey're gonna get us! -OG}Hey, we need to get them\Nbefore they get us!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.29,0:24:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire! Send them to the depths!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.73,0:24:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slave...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.46,0:24:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Arrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.50,0:24:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wh-What just happened? -OG}Wha...? What just happened?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.44,0:24:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.54,0:24:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kuja Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.91,0:24:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,put a Navy ship...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.95,0:24:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in my way?{black flash here????? -Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.40,0:24:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's Kuja's logo! -OG}{That's the Kuja's logo!}{Ryan- feels weird without "the" here, since they're always "the Kuja Pirates/Tribe etc.}That's... the Kuja Jolly Roger!{Z- it's not weird anymore}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.37,0:24:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "Kuja"?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.87,0:24:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're strong amazonian pirates led\Nby a pirate empress - a Warlord. -OG}They're strong, Amazonian pirates led\Nby the Pirate Empress, one of the Warlords.{-Ryan}{Z- capitalized "Amazonian" because it's a demonym. Also, I put a comma after "strong"}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.71,0:24:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A warlord?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.11,0:24:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her name is Boa Hancock.{Lit: "The empress Boa Hancock", i.e. no "Her name is"}
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.18,0:25:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They say anyone who sees her will be attracted by her beauty and turned to stone in the end. -OG}{They say anyone who sees her will be infatuated with her and turn to stone.-Ryan}They say anyone who sees her becomes\Ninfatuated and turns into stone.{Evo}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.25,0:25:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bright! She is dazzling!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.32,0:25:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no end to her beauty!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.69,0:25:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wow! She must be a goddess! -OG}You weren't kidding! She's a goddess!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.26,0:25:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.86,0:25:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is she?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.83,0:25:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess? Goddess?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.16,0:25:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess... Oh, goddess... Oh, goddess... G... G... Goddess...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.77,0:25:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{--G...\N--He turned to stone! -OG}He turned to stone!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.17,0:25:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, that's Hancock and the others! -OG}Hey, that's Hancock and her pirates!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.01,0:25:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,–Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.57,0:25:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move your ship, Boa Hancock!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.31,0:25:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Are you trying to interfere\Nwith us fulfilling our duty? -OG}Are you trying to interfere with our duties?{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.71,0:25:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{No, I'm not! - OG}Cease your baseless accusations!{arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.68,0:25:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I just don't feel like making way for you. -OG}I just don't feel like moving out of the way.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.98,0:25:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's acting like a child!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.65,0:25:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?{OG}{Got a problem? -Ryan}{Z- I preferred the OG line}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.89,0:25:44.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{Go, Luffy... Now is the chance! -OG}{Go, Luffy... now's your chance! -Ryan}Go, Luffy. Now is your chance!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She just winked at us...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.70,0:25:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She helped us.\NLet's set sail now!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.07,0:25:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You know that Warlord?}You know that warlord?{Evo: if I'm reading the reference guide correctly, no capitalization should be here.}
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.94,0:25:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I was sent to the Maiden Island\Nand I became friends with them. -OG}Yeah... I was sent to the Isle of Women\Nand became friends with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.64,0:26:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's the legendary\Nfemale-only island, right? -OG}{That's the legendary\Nwomen-only island, right? -Ryan}That's the legendary island\Nfull to the brim with women{where only women are allowed}.{Z}{lit: "island full of women", not "women only" - arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.81,0:26:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I didn't know they were real... -OG}I didn't know it was real...{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.68,0:26:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Friend with the pirate empress?! -OG}Friends with the Pirate Empress?!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.51,0:26:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, were you really training hard?! -OG}Hey! Did you even get any training done?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.89,0:26:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I'm so ready! -OG}Yeah, I'm all set!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.05,0:26:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn... It's not fair...! It's not fair...!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.89,0:26:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What's the matter, Sanji? -OG}You doing okay, Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.36,0:26:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so they're Luffy's friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.40,0:26:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of creatures\Nthat I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.83,0:26:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{--1, 2, 3, 4...\N--Looks like they're having fun! -OG}– One, two, three, four...\N– Looks like they're having fun!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.17,0:26:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get ready to set sail now!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.14,0:26:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{--Yeah!\N--Yes, Nami-san! -OG}– Yeah!\N– Yes, Nami-{\i1}swan{\i0}!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.91,0:26:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter, Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.94,0:26:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I was just thinking...\Ndid you guys beat all those Navy soldiers? -OG}It's just that...\Ndid you guys beat back all those marines?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.05,0:26:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{No, we heard them shouting\Nwhile we were flying. -OG}No. We could still hear them\Nshouting as we were flying away.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.62,0:26:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, why aren't they coming\Nafter us from inland?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.43,0:26:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Reinforcement Platoon 3!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.67,0:26:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.00,0:27:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's wrong? What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.97,0:27:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't get to Grove 42!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.61,0:27:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Why is that? -OG}Why?!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.71,0:27:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.74,0:27:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{there are huge bugs standing in our way... -OG}there are huge bugs standing in our way!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.55,0:27:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? Bugs?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.92,0:27:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are they?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.42,0:27:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.20,0:27:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let them mess\Nwith Usopp-{\i1}un{\i0}'s new adventure-{\i1}un{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.67,0:27:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When men part ways,\Nwe don't shed tears-{\i1}un{\i0}.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Usopp-{\i1}un{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as they're not coming, that's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.55,0:27:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If they're in trouble, we're lucky. -OG}If they're having trouble, we're lucky.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.05,0:27:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave now!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.35,0:27:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, lead the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You can count on me! -OG}Leave it to me!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.56,0:27:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Platoon 4.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.03,0:28:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.77,0:28:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All of the sudden,\Nit started raining and the gunpowder got wet! -OG}It suddenly started raining,\Nand the wet gunpowder won't ignite!{-Ryan}{Z- placed a comma after "raining"}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.10,0:28:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Rain? Where? -OG}Rain? Where is it raining?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Rain? Where? -OG}Rain? Where is it raining?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.14,0:28:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabaody Archipelago should be\Nclear and sunny today!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.95,0:28:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No thunder.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.78,0:28:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We don't want\Nnormal people to get hurt.}We don't want civilians to get hurt.{Byron}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.05,0:28:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The bubbles are a pain in the neck here. -OG}The bubbles are so bothersome...{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.06,0:28:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But I can't believe we\Ncaught such perfect wind. -OG}I can't believe we caught\Nsuch a perfect wind.{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It brought us here just as we wanted. -OG}{It brought us right where we wanted. -Ryan}It brought us right to Sabaody Archipelago.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because Nami-{\i1}chan{\i0} is a good girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.10,0:28:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Good luck!\NWe will miss you on Weatheria! -OG}Best of luck!\NWe'll miss you up here on Weatheria!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.42,0:29:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's inflating!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.66,0:29:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? This jelly inflates?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.07,0:29:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, we got a bubble roof!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.74,0:29:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Listen, guys. -OG}Listen, everyone.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.44,0:29:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A coated ship can mitigate\Nany kind of pressure.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.18,0:29:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So once the floating bag at the ship's\Nbottom which keeps it on the surface -OG}{Once the floating bag under the ship that keeps it afloat is removed, - combined with next line -Ryan}{Once the floating bag at the bottom of the\Nship that keeps it above water is removed, - Evo}{Z- maybe this should be called something like "the floater bag" or "the bouyancy bag." Also, can probably remove "that keeps it above water" since the next line covers this by saying "and start to sink"}Once Franky removes the buoyancy bag\Nsupporting the ship's keel,{arch: I like "buoyancy bag" more than "floater bag" bc of the alliteration, but I can't find a translation that doesn't use buoyancy in the next line.}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.68,0:29:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{it'll be less buoyant and start to sink.}the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}'s coating will make her start to sink.{arch - lit: "the coated Sunny" ... "will start to sink to the bottom"}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.62,0:29:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how it works.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.62,0:29:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I see.\N– I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.22,0:29:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too complicated, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.69,0:29:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, lower the sail now!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.83,0:29:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sail?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.66,0:29:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rather than the wind,\Nsea currents drive a coated sailing ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.83,0:29:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I thought it just submerged and traveled}So it doesn't just sink to where it's going.{lit: "So it doesn't just arrive [at its destination] on its own after sinking..." -arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.54,0:29:49.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Alright, we better hurry\Nbefore the Navy comes again! -OG}Alright! Let's hurry\Nbefore the Navy shows up again!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.71,0:29:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Central Platoon 5 at Grove 42!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.08,0:29:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency situation!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.74,0:29:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All the troops in Platoon 2 that\Ncame before have become negative... -OG}{All the troops in Platoon 2\Nfrom earlier have become negative... -Ryan}The troops that came before us,\NPlatoon 2, have all... er... become negative!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.65,0:30:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{What are you saying? Negative?! -OG}What are you talking about? "Negative"?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become like moss...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.05,0:30:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm no good.\NI wanna become a water flea...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.85,0:30:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to them, Straw Hat Luffy\Ngot on a giant bird and flew away!{merged with next line-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.63,0:30:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bird? What are you guys doing now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.20,0:30:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're fighting against unknown enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.20,0:30:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy reinforcements!\NWe were about to leave...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody!{VG- audio is off}{TRUEEEE CHECK THIS -Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.74,0:30:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's ship is in range now!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.51,0:30:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!\NA giant bird is coming toward us!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.53,0:30:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're coming from behind too! -OG}They're behind us now!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.86,0:30:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.77,0:30:51.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{How do you like it, Nami-san? -OG}How's that, Nami-{\i1}san{\i0}?{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{Did you see me... -OG}{Can you see... -Ryan}Please be watching me...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.30,0:30:55.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{getting stronger? -OG}{that I've gotten stronger? -Ryan}See how much stronger I've become.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.80,0:30:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.54,0:31:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Respond, Platoon 5! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.55,0:31:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{W-We are... -OG}W-We're...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.61,0:31:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're facing...\Nan unexpected obstacle...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.25,0:31:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.22,0:31:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How could you turn us down?! -OG}How dare you reject us like that!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.26,0:31:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're all shy.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.70,0:31:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be ashamed!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.20,0:31:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let's have a cup of tea together! -OG}Let's go out for tea sometime!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.90,0:31:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I-I-I'm gonna go out of my mind! -OG}I-I-I'm going...\NI'm going crazy, aren't I?!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.44,0:31:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! You've got such a cute face!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.21,0:31:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.25,0:31:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's wrong? Answer, Platoon 5!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.76,0:31:49.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{Sanji-kun, now is the chance! -OG}Sanji-{\i1}kyun{\i0}, now's your chance!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.46,0:31:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's wrong, Sanji?!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:55.06,0:32:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I-I don't know... Suddenly, it felt like\Nsomeone was squeezing my heart...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.24,0:32:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The floating bag is removed! - OG}{I got the floating bag off! -Ryan}{Z- OG line has better brevity and conciseness for the situation}I removed the buoyancy bag!{arch: OG but for consistency with 28:46}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.87,0:32:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Okay! What about sail? -OG}Okay! What about the sail?{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.04,0:32:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We're ready! -OG}We're ready when you are!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.91,0:32:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it time to go, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.41,0:32:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, at your command, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.75,0:32:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.43,0:32:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.26,0:32:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I've got a lot of things that I want\Nto share with you but in any case, -OG}There's so much I want to tell you,\Nbut first of all,{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.23,0:32:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thank you for going along\Nwith my selfish decision for two years!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.24,0:32:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That wasn't the first time. -OG}It's not as if that's the first time.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.04,0:32:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's right! You've always been selfish! - OG}He's right! You've always been that way!{arch: This is literal and doesn't repeat "selfish". Maybe "like that" -> "that way"}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.81,0:32:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Rear Admiral-dono, the\Npirate ship is submerging! -OG}Rear Admiral,\Nthe pirate ship is submerging!{-Ryan}{lit: "The pirate ship is escaping underwater" -arch}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.72,0:32:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Curses!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.72,0:32:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.09,0:32:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.99,0:32:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{how heinous they are? Hey! -OG}how evil those pirates are? Hey!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.56,0:32:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.96,0:33:02.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care, Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:05.40,0:33:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Spread the sail! -OG}{Unfurl the sails! -Ryan}Unfurl the sails!{Evo: "unfurl" seems a bit fancy for Luffy, but feel free to revert if it's literal.}
Dialogue: 50,0:33:07.57,0:33:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{--Yes!\N--Yeah! -OG}– Yes!\N– Yeah!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 50,0:33:16.41,0:33:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.41,0:33:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.29,0:33:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let's go to the Fish-Man Island! -OG}Let's go to Fishman Island!{-Ryan}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:37.31,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,757)\fad(720,800)\blur1\bord2.3\fscx132\fscy132\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(675,720,\1a&H00&)\t(5980,6025,\1a&HFF&)}Dive, Dive, Dive!
